<SiteLayout
	title="Our DC Origins: The 2012 Bait-Bike Proposal | Bait Bikes"
	description="A historical 2012 Washington, DC bicycle-theft proposal from Alexander D. Mills, and what changed in a modern, city-agnostic approach."
